Lexora — AI Legal Assistant

Lexora is an AI-powered legal assistant designed to help users understand legal topics and get answers to common legal questions through a simple chat interface.

Features
* AI-powered legal Q&A: Ask questions about legal topics and receive AI-generated responses.
* User-friendly interface: Interact with the assistant through a web-based chat application.
* Legal information support: Get help understanding legal concepts and procedures.
* Web application: Built with Python and Flask.

Tech Stack
* Python
* Flask
* Groq API
* HTML and CSS

Getting Started

1. Clone the repository
git clone https://github.com/rohininagraj/Lexora.git
cd Lexora

2. Install dependencies
pip install -r requirements.txt

3. Configure API keys
Set up the API keys required by the application as environment variables. Check app.py for the exact variable names.
Never commit API keys, passwords, or other secrets to GitHub.

4. Run the application
python app.py
Open the local address displayed in your terminal in your browser.

